<title>THAILAND: Thai bourse suspends Union Bank shares.</title>
<headline>Thai bourse suspends Union Bank shares.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand on Friday suspended trading in the shares of Union Bank Plc, as it awaited material information disclosure from the bank.</p>
<p>The SET did not specify what sort of information was being awaited.</p>
<p>The exchange earlier halted trading in shares of Union Bank, one of the smallest banks in Thailand.</p>
<p>The bank's shareholders in January settled a seven year dispute over who should control of the bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
